{{DISPLAYTITLE:Eco-Friendly Fuel}}

Eco-Friendly Fuel is a crafted item used to increase speed of Farm Vehicles, Ships, and powers [[Shroudlights]]. 
[[File:Ecofriendlyfuel.png|alt=Eco-Friendly Fuel|thumb|Eco-Friendly Fuel]]
[[File:Ecofriendlyfuel craft.png|alt=Eco-Friendly Fuel - Crafting Details|thumb|Eco-Friendly Fuel - Crafting Details]]
Eco-Friendly Fuel is crafted at Farmer's Workstations, of [[Hay Bale|Hay Bales]], and Organic Fertilizer.

